cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: cdc-health-mcp-server
abstract: "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for CDC public health data: the CDC Open Data portal (~1,080 datasets via the Socrata SODA API), with catalog discovery, schema inspection, and SoQL queries across disease surveillance, mortality, vaccinations, behavioral risk factors, and other domains, plus national mortality statistics from five CDC WONDER databases."
type: software
authors:
